  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to configure an alternative ISPN backend (JDBC?) and test for basic functionality.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If an alternative backend works, create a follow-on ticket for investigating the performance relative to the current LevelDB backend.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "If performance is promising, create a follow-on-follow-on ticket for investigating a LevelDB-to-JDBC (or other) backend migration.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
