     "body": "<p>Potentially helpful references:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.jboss.org/author/display/MODE40/Binary+values#Binaryvalues-ConfiguringBinaryStores\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://docs.jboss.org/author/display/MODE40/Binary+values#Binaryvalues-ConfiguringBinaryStores</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ModeShape/modeshape/blob/master/modeshape-jcr/src/main/resources/org/modeshape/jcr/repository-config-schema.json\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/ModeShape/modeshape/blob/master/modeshape-jcr/src/main/resources/org/modeshape/jcr/repository-config-schema.json</a> (search: \"database\")</li>\n</ul>\n",
