    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/978\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/978</a></p>\n\n<p>As of this update, the default backend is still LevelDB.<br/>\nTo use the MySQL object store, you need to:<br/>\n1. Install an instance of MySQL<br/>\n2. Run Fedora with the following JAVA_OPTS:</p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>JAVA_OPTS=\"${JAVA_OPTS} -Dfcrepo.modeshape.configuration=classpath:/config/jdbc-mysql/repository.json\"\r\nJAVA_OPTS=\"${JAVA_OPTS} -Dfcrepo.ispn.mysql.username=&lt;username&gt;\"\r\nJAVA_OPTS=\"${JAVA_OPTS} -Dfcrepo.ispn.mysql.password=&lt;password&gt;\"\r\nJAVA_OPTS=\"${JAVA_OPTS} -Dfcrepo.ispn.mysql.host=&lt;default=localhost&gt;\"\r\nJAVA_OPTS=\"${JAVA_OPTS} -Dfcrepo.ispn.mysql.port=&lt;default=3306&gt;\"\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>Note, the database and table used by ISPN are auto-created.</p>",
     "created": "08/Feb/16 8:55 PM",
     "id": "16082",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11794/comment/16082",
