     "body": "<p>I was able to get this working, but had to update my.cnf to require latin1:</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;client&#93;</span><br/>\ndefault-character-set=latin1</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;mysql&#93;</span><br/>\ndefault-character-set=latin1</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;mysqld&#93;</span><br/>\ncollation-server = latin1_general_cs<br/>\ninit-connect=\"SET NAMES latin1'<br/>\ncharacter-set-server = latin1</p>",
